<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Messina H1 attrib income dips, no div.</title>
<headline>Messina H1 attrib income dips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to 31 December 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.5	   vs 3.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income	  5.4	   vs 5.9</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.9	   vs 2.3</p>
<p>    Net investment income 2.3	   vs 2.0</p>
<p>Operating income before depreciation</p>
<p>				  4.6	   vs 5.3</p>
<p>Full name: Messina Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said no dividend had been declared. They said net expenditure onthe Messina Platinum project of 500,000 rand in the review period was limited to care and maintenance of the site and installations.</p>
<p>They said the project would not be resuscitated until sustainable metals prices were achieved. The current cash balance of 39.4 million available for expenditure on the project would be utilised towards meeting the costs of mothballing and of the initial financing required on recommencement of the project.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
